### Component 3: Mongoose Persistence (`src/models/`)

#### [NEW] [ArchitectureResult.model.ts](file:///d:/snist%20hackathon/src/models/ArchitectureResult.model.ts)
- Mongoose schema for `ArchitectureResultRecord` (`projectId`, `architectureId`, `status`, `result`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`).
- Exports helper `persistArchitectureResult(projectId, result)`.

---

### Component 4: Graph Node & Graph Routing (`src/graph/`)

#### [NEW] [ctoNode.ts](file:///d:/snist%20hackathon/src/graph/nodes/ctoNode.ts)
- Graph node `ctoNode(state)`: calls `runCTO`, emits SSE events (`agent_started`, `agent_completed`, `agent_failed`), tracks token usage, persists result to MongoDB.

#### [MODIFY] [hackforgeGraph.ts](file:///d:/snist%20hackathon/src/graph/hackforgeGraph.ts)
- Integrate `ctoNode` into the graph.
- Add helper function `resumeAfterTechStackSelection(projectId, currentState)` to execute Agent 5 after user selects a tech stack option.

